## Title: Console Port |cff69ccf0Gamepad Slots|r
## Notes: Lets ConsolePort bind keys to the native gamepad action storage slots (181-360, same range Forever/LyraelForever uses), pages them by stance following ConsolePort's own pager, adds a bindable gamepad targeting-cone mode, and switches Turn With Camera while a modifier is held. Third-party, not an official ConsolePort module.
